<html lang="ko">
<head><title>전체 TNS 디스크립터</title></head>
<body style="${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE}">
전체 TNS 디스크립터<br>
선택한 프로파일의 전체 TNS 디스크립터를 사용하는 Thin JDBC URL<br><br>

예:<br>
<span style="${MONOSPACE_LARGE_FONT_STYLE}">
    jdbc:oracle:thin:@(DESCRIPTION=(ADDRESS=(PROTOCOL=TCP)
    <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(Host=localhost)(Port=1521))
    <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(CONNECT_DATA=(SID=XE)(GLOBAL_NAME=XE)))</span>
<br>
<br>
</body>
</html>

